  "type": "module",
  "//": "exports: the app's modules the site (apps/site) imports. Each is pure when loaded: no DOM, no storage, no state, nothing that runs on import. A stateful module (the lobby, the HUD, main.ts) is never exported (docs/architecture.md §1).",
  "exports": {
